"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4658180","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1847286114042608","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"We're in Games That Ace It!","summary":"Hi everyone!It's a special day! Not only is it the final day of Steam Next Fest, but it's also the first day of Games That Ace It! The event celebrates games made by ace developers in honor of Ace Week. There's so much good stuff in the festival, so make sure you go support the other devs and their games! And, of course, if you haven't already, don't forget to wishlist the game!teaisfortoby!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:15:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042608","verified_at":"2026-10-25T20:16:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1846651706691638","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"We're in Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hi hi!PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE is a part of Steam Next Fest, just in time for the spooky season! No update to the demo this time, but if you or a friend haven't given it a try yet, now's your chance...Please stay tuned for some exciting news soon. And don't forget to wishlist the game!teaisfortoby!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:12:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1845383656381883","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG 4 - Animating Puzzles","summary":"Hi hi!It’s devlog time! I’m teaisfortoby, the developer of PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE. Good to have you back!NEWSIn terms of development, the game is very polished by this point. So, this month, I’ve been working on getting more good press for the game. This means a lot of fun things have been happening behind the scenes… but I can’t share them yet. Please stay tuned!!Also, once again… I’ve made another game!For the Spooktober VN JAM 2026, I made caduceus, a disability horror yuri time loop. Time loop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T15:39:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381883","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1842212951311302","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG 3 - Designing an Environment","summary":"Hi hi!We’re back! I’m teaisfortoby, the developer of the mystery puzzle game PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE. I’ve been quite busy recently, so let’s get to it!NEWSIt’s been a pretty hectic month for me personally, but development is still going strong. Mostly, I’ve been squashing bugs and rigorously testing the full release. All of this is to say: I don’t have anything to announce yet, but I’m still hard at work!I did send out a postmortem about my other game, A field of broken glass, so check that out if","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T19:38:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311302","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1840944183774838","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for v0.90.3","summary":"Hi everyone! This is another mini update to catch some small lingering issues. Before I dive into the patch notes, I wanted to say thank you all for reaching out whenever you encounter bugs. I realized that there wasn't a clear place for people to send in bug reports... that changes now!If you run into a bug, please send an email to teaisfortoby@outlook.com. When you send an email, please also:Try to recreate the bug before you send it in!Take screenshots or video footage of the bug if you can.N","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T19:13:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774838","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1839676055888621","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG 2 - Drawing Character Portraits","summary":"Hi hi!Welcome back, everyone! I’m teaisfortoby, the developer of PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE. I hope you all had a restful Disability Pride Month! In case you missed it, some cool stuff happened this month...NEWSWe were a part of the Nonbinary Coded Games event on Steam a few weeks ago, and the demo got a tiiiiiny little cosmetic update to celebrate. If you haven’t played the demo yet, you totally should, but should ALSO go check out all the other games featured in the event here!In terms of developmen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T15:48:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055888621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1837955055364041","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"update","title":"A small demo update for the Nonbinary Coded Games event!!","summary":"Hi hi!The Nonbinary Coded Games event is live right now!! If you didn't know, it's Nonbinary Awareness Week, and tomorrow is International Nonbinary People's Day. In its honor, the event's showing off games made by nonbinary devs (that's me!) and games featuring nonbinary characters (me again!). A ton of other games are on sale, have new demos dropping, or are releasing today. Go support your nonbinary devs!!To celebrate the event, there's been a small update to the demo. Four new menu styles ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T17:16:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364041","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1836506165563322","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVLOG 1 - The Initial Concept","summary":"Hi hi! Welcome! I’m teaisfortoby, the developer of the mystery puzzle game PATIENCE IS A VIRTUE. This is the very first devlog! We've got a lot to cover, so let's just dive in.NEWSIt’s been a very busy month for the game! The Wholesome Direct showed off our first trailer, and the demo released on Steam! The support so far has been unbelievable. I never imagined so many people would be interested in this story. Thank you all so so much! If you haven’t watched the trailer, here’s your chance:Also,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T18:03:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165563322","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4656880-1835236783564858","game_id":"steam-4656880","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes for v0.90.1","summary":"Hi everyone! Thank you so so much for your support so far! This will likely be the first of a few small updates to the demo before the full release.Patch NotesAn additional content warning has been added to the game’s splash screen intro. The content warnings option’s toggle descriptions have been reworded for clarity.To add to this point, the content warnings toggle in the Options menu allows you to choose whether you receive a warning about sensitive content before it occurs in-game. This opti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T22:44:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4656880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4656880":"2026-10-26T13:17:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4656880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:04Z"},"4658180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:17:05Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4656880","app_id":4656880,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f2c14aac5e6995fe251655fd0746fc0744a84ae1d95639793db52e3c64f082b5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Something's hiding in the cassette. Rearrange the words of your enemies to investigate a small-town conspiracy in this mystery puzzle game.","publishers":[{"name":"teaisfortoby!","creator_clan_account_id":46139010}],"developers":[{"name":"teaisfortoby!","creator_clan_account_id":46139010}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Announcem